<view class="page">
  <view class="blobs">
    <view class="blob blob--1"></view>
    <view class="blob blob--2"></view>
    <view class="blob blob--3"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero__title">加入班级</view>
    <view class="hero__sub">输入老师给的 6 位邀请码，或用微信扫班级二维码</view>
  </view>

  <view class="block">
    <view class="block__title">班级邀请码</view>
    <input
      class="code-input"
      type="text"
      placeholder="如 ACDE34"
      maxlength="10"
      value="{{code}}"
      bindinput="onInput"
      confirm-type="done"
      bindconfirm="join"
    />
    <view class="btn-row">
      <view class="btn pressable {{joining ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" hover-class="pressing" bindtap="join">
        {{joining ? '加入中…' : '加入班级'}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="tip">
      邀请码不区分大小写。加入后可向该班提交每周学习汇报，一个账号可加入多个班级。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
